<title>USA: Swiss RE buys 1 mln CapMac shrs.</title>
<headline>Swiss RE buys 1 mln CapMac shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>CapMAC Holdings Inc said Wednesday that Swiss Reinsurance Co has purchased one million shares of already outstanding stock, primarily from certain founding stockholders.</p>
<p>Swiss Re purchased the CapMAC shares in a privately negotiated transaction with sellers consisting primarily of founding investors in CapMAC, it said.</p>
<p>No new shares were issued. There are about 16.9 million CapMAC Holdings shares outstanding. Of that total, Swiss Re holds about 5.9 percent.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
